n and living room;    * 1 bedroom;    * 2 additional rooms, ideal for bedrooms, one of which has a walk-in wardrobe;    * 1 bathroom;    * Storage room with space for appliances.         The prime location means you’re just a few minutes away from shops, amenities, schools, municipal swimming pools and public transport.    Distances:    * 15 minutes from Arruda dos Vinhos and Torres Vedras;    * 15 minutes from the A8 (Pero Negro);    * 15 minutes from the A10 (Arruda dos Vinhos);    * 40 minutes from Lisbon.    If you are looking for a modern, well-located flat with excellent transport links, this is an excellent opportunity.    In September, the Summer Festival and Fair takes place, featuring a week-long programme of various activities, including concerts, exhibitions and bullfighting-related events, amongst others.    In October, the ’Tasquinhas’ take place, offering plenty of entertainment. Throughout the rest of the year, there are various leisure options and activities available.    Book your viewing now!!!;ID RE/MAX: (telefone)  #ref:125001166-86",
